=> Question 1 - Banking Transaction Processing

     -> Start by creating a transaction list.

     -> Initial transactions:

          TXN103
          TXN101
          TXN105
          TXN102
          TXN104

     -> Perform the following operations:

          -> Display the oldest transaction.

          -> Display the newest transaction.

          -> Add urgent transaction:
               TXN100
             at the beginning.

          -> Add normal transaction:
               TXN106
             at the end.

          -> Remove the oldest transaction after processing.

          -> Remove the newest transaction after cancellation.

          -> Display the transaction history from newest to oldest.

